 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Building number nine has Mr. Hale's name on the door.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "In gold.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": "gold",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Six, seven and eight came down in the autumn.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "That left the big one.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hale Tower.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Grandpa's reports say the foundation is cracking.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": "crack",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "A little more every year.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "We took the reports to the city.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "They told us to take a number and wait.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mr. Hale was already there.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting too.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "For an hour nobody spoke.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I saw his phone.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "He was playing the same game as me.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Badly.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": "game",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked at my screen.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"You rush the first move.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "So did Kaya.\"",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he said the rest, quietly.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The cheap concrete was my idea.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "When it went wrong, your grandfather signed the papers.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "He took the blame.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": "blame",
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "I took the company.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "I wanted your list so nobody would ever read it.\"",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "They called his number.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "He stood up.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"He carried it for forty years.",
   "nefes": 0.1,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "I can carry the last one.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Hale"
  },
  {
   "text": "Empty my tower.\"",
   "nefes": 0,
   "mark": "end",
   "kim": "Hale"
  }
